WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Our episodes deal with serious and often distressing incidents. If you feel at any time you need support, please contact your local crisis centre. For suggested phone numbers for confidential support, please see the show notes for this episode on your app or on our website. The month of April marks the beginning of the spring trophy fishing season throughout the United States. The warmer weather attracts a wide variety of deep water fish to the shallows to spawn and recreational anglers across the country flock to lakes, rivers and beaches hoping
我们的节目涉及严重且往往令人痛苦的事件。如果您在任何时候感到需要支持，请联系您当地的危机中心。有关获得保密支持的建议电话号码，请查看您使用的应用程序或我们网站上的本期节目简介。四月份标志着全美春季大型垂钓季节的开始。较暖和的天气吸引了各种深水鱼类来到浅水区产卵，全国各地的休闲垂钓者纷纷涌向湖泊、河流和海滩，希望

2
00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:32.000
to reel in a valuable catch. One such popular fishing spot is Chesapeake Bay in the country's east, a 200-mile-long estuary that encompasses the states of Maryland and Virginia, eventually meeting with the Atlantic Ocean at its outlet. The bay boasts a wide range of marine life, with delicacies like striped bass, crabs and oysters among the most prized bounty. Hobby fishing season was well underway by May 5, 2004, yet that particular Wednesday presented a miserable morning for those casting a line into Chesapeake Bay.
钓到一条宝贵的鱼。切萨皮克湾（Chesapeake Bay）是该国东部一个很受欢迎的钓鱼点，这是一个长达 200 英里的河口，横跨马里兰州和弗吉尼亚州，最终在入海口与大西洋交汇。该海湾拥有丰富的海洋生物，条纹鲈鱼、螃蟹和牡蛎等美味佳肴是最珍贵的战利品之一。到 2004 年 5 月 5 日，业余钓鱼季已经全面展开，然而对于那些在切萨皮克湾垂钓的人来说，那个特定的星期三却是一个糟糕的早晨。

3
00:01:32.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Local hobby fishermen and longtime friends, Chris Henkel and Dee Connors, had taken to the water by boat, but the rough weather had forced them to drop anchor at Fisherman Island, the meeting point between the bay and the ocean. The area was offering little apart from mud sharks and small fry, which was a disappointment, especially for these two young children, Sam and Claire, who had come along for their inaugural fishing trip. By 10am, the rain and wind finally subsided, restoring calm to the waves and bringing a welcomed touch of sun.
当地的业余渔民兼多年好友克里斯·亨克尔（Chris Henkel）和迪·康纳斯（Dee Connors）乘船下水，但恶劣的天气迫使他们在渔人岛（Fisherman Island）抛锚，这里是海湾和大西洋的交汇点。除了泥鲨和小鱼之外，该地区几乎没有什么收获，这让人感到失望，尤其是对于第一次参加钓鱼之旅的两个年幼的孩子萨姆（Sam）和克莱尔（Claire）来说。到了上午 10 点，雨和风终于停了，海浪恢复了平静，并带来了久违的阳光。

4
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:54.000
When the clouds finally parted, the men saw an opportunity to set sail for more fruitful waters, where they were guaranteed a better catch. Stretching above and below their boat was the Chesapeake Bay Bridge Tunnel, a 17.6 mile transit complex comprising of two bridges and two underwater tunnels. It facilitated traffic between Virginia's detached coastline, allowing travellers a faster and more direct route from the mainland to adjoining states. A series of four artificial islands marked the points where the bridge dipped below the surface of the water, transforming into the tunnel, before re-emerging.
当云层终于散开时，男人们看到了起航前往更肥沃水域的机会，在那里他们可以保证有更好的收获。在他们的船上下方延伸的是切萨皮克湾桥隧（Chesapeake Bay Bridge Tunnel），这是一处长 17.6 英里的交通综合体，由两座桥梁和两条水下隧道组成。它便利了弗吉尼亚州分离海岸线之间的交通，使旅客能够以更快、更直接的路线从大陆通往毗邻各州。一系列四座人工岛标志着桥梁沉入水面以下变成隧道并再次浮出水面的位置。

5
00:02:54.000 --> 00:03:33.000
Chris and Dee directed their boat past the fourth island, where they caught sight of something floating in the water alongside their vessel. It was a dark green suitcase. Given its proximity to the bridge, the man assumed it must have blown off the luggage rack of a people driving above and hauled it on board. Twelve-year-old Sam expressed his excitement at thinking they had stumbled upon Pirate's treasure and hastily zipped the bag open, finding it held items wrapped in thick black garbage bags sealed with blue adhesive tape.
克里斯和迪将船驶过第四座岛屿，在那里他们看到船旁的水面上漂浮着什么东西。那是一个深绿色的手提箱。鉴于它离桥很近，这个人推测它一定是从上面开车的人的行李架上吹落的，于是把它拉到了船上。12 岁的萨姆表达了他的兴奋，以为他们偶然发现了海盗的宝藏，并匆忙拉开包的拉链，发现里面装着包裹在厚黑色垃圾袋里的物品，并用蓝色胶带封好。

6
00:03:33.000 --> 00:04:36.000
Before anyone could stop him, Sam tore open one of the bags and screamed in horror as he discovered what lay inside. The garbage bags contained the pale legs of an adult human male severed at the knee joints. The suitcase didn't appear to have been in Chesapeake Bay for long. It featured the branding of American fashion house and designer Kenneth Cole, who sold a wide range of clothing, shoes and accessories. The medium-sized bag was a part of the casual and affordable reaction collection and featured
还没等任何人阻止他，萨姆就撕开了一个袋子，惊恐地尖叫起来，因为他发现了里面是什么。垃圾袋里装着成年人类男性的苍白腿部，在膝关节处被切断。这个手提箱看起来在切萨皮克湾没有呆多久。它印有美国时装屋和设计师肯尼斯·科尔（Kenneth Cole）的品牌，该公司销售各种服装、鞋子和配饰。这个中等大小的包是休闲实惠的 reaction 系列的一部分，并配有

7
00:04:36.000 --> 00:05:21.000
a retractable handle, wheels and black detailing. The following day, the local newspaper, The Virginian Pilot, ran a short, three-sentence article on the grim discovery, but the lack of details ensured it garnered little attention. Many suspected the lack of media coverage was an intentional act to ensure the gruesome homicide would not impact visitor numbers to the famed Virginia Beach. Six days later, at around midday on Monday, May 10, a graduate student cleaning up litter on the shores of Fisherman Island's bird sanctuary spotted a large, dark green suitcase lying on the sand.
可伸缩手柄、轮子和黑色细节。第二天，当地报纸《弗吉尼亚飞行员报》（The Virginian Pilot）刊登了一篇关于这一可怕发现的简短的三句话文章，但由于缺乏细节，它几乎没有引起人们的注意。许多人怀疑缺乏媒体报道是有意为之，以确保这起可怕的谋杀案不会影响著名弗吉尼亚海滩的游客数量。六天后的 5 月 10 日星期一中午左右，一名在渔人岛鸟类保护区海岸清理垃圾的研究生在沙滩上发现了一个大型深绿色手提箱。

8
00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:56.000
She ignored the item, only to notice it was still there when she returned to the shoreline the following day. Moving into her curiosity, she unzipped the bag and released the nauseating stench of rot from within. It contained an item wrapped in black garbage bags that, upon closer inspection, made the student recoil in horror. Police arrived and immediately recognized the suitcase as a larger version of the one found days earlier that contained the severed legs.
她忽略了这个物件，直到第二天她回到海岸时才发现它还在那里。出于好奇，她拉开了包的拉链，里面散发出令人作呕的腐臭味。它里面装着一个用黑色垃圾袋包裹的东西，经过仔细检查，让这名学生惊恐地退缩了。警察赶到现场，立即认出这个手提箱是几天前发现的装有被砍断的腿的那个手提箱的更大版本。

9
00:05:56.000 --> 00:06:35.000
This one was in worse condition, having been beached in the hot sun for days with the surf causing it to become severely waterlogged and filled with sand. Two layers of garbage bags concealed a human torso with the head and arms still attached. The victim was a Caucasian male aged between 30 and 40 with a muscular physique and short brown hair. Several gunshot wounds were found throughout his body, with those in the skull and abdomen proving fatal. X-ray imagery revealed two bullets still nestled in the victim's chest and waist.
这一个状况更糟，在炎热的阳光下搁浅了好几天，海浪使其严重进水并充满了沙子。两层垃圾袋藏匿着一个人类躯干，头部和手臂仍然连着。受害者是一名 30 至 40 岁的白人男性，体格健壮，留着短棕色头发。他的全身有多处枪伤，其中头骨和腹部的枪伤是致命的。X 光影像显示，受害者的胸部和腰部仍然嵌有两颗子弹。

10
00:06:35.000 --> 00:07:23.000
One was covered in green fibres, having passed through fabric before penetrating the body. A blanket tucked behind the victim's head featured a tag that read, Property of H-C-S-C, initials for US-based healthcare organization Hospital Central Services Cooperative. The organization provided a variety of services, including an expansive laundry division that supplied linen to medical clinics across the country. A five-and-a-half pound weight marked with the fitness brand name WEDA was stored in an outside pocket of the suitcase in a bid to weigh it down. Both recovered cases were part of a three-piece luggage set sold by Kenneth Cole.
其中一颗被绿色纤维覆盖，因为它在穿透身体之前穿过了织物。塞在受害者头部后面的一条毯子上有一个标签，上面写着“H-C-S-C 财产”，这是美国医疗保健组织 Hospital Central Services Cooperative 的首字母缩写。该组织提供各种服务，包括一个庞大的洗衣部门，为全国的医疗诊所提供床单。一个重五磅半、印有健身品牌名称 WEDA 的哑铃存放在手提箱的外袋中，企图将其压沉。两个找回的箱子都是肯尼斯·科尔出售的三件套行李箱的一部分。

11
00:07:23.000 --> 00:08:06.000
The third and final case in the set, the smallest one typically used as carry-on luggage by passengers on long-haul flights, was still unaccounted for. The perpetrator's use of a firearm and the clinical dismemberment of the victim led Virginia police to theorize that the killing was a gangland-style hit. As for identifying their John Doe, officers checked recent missing persons reports and turned their attention to the state's large military population, as his cropped haircut and muscular physique were akin to the conditions required for serving members of the armed forces.
套装中的第三个也是最后一个箱子，即通常被长途航班乘客用作随身行李的最小箱子，仍然下落不明。凶手使用枪械以及对受害者进行临床分尸，让弗吉尼亚警方推测这起谋杀案是一起黑帮风格的谋杀。至于确认他们的无名尸体（John Doe），警官们查阅了最近的失踪人口报告，并将注意力转向了该州庞大的军队人口，因为他剪短的头发和健壮的体格类似于武装部队现役人员所需条件。

12
00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:53.000
The suitcases were believed to have been discarded into Chesapeake Bay from the bridge above, but as the structure lacked security cameras, no such act was caught on film. The midsection of the victim was still missing, from the belly button to the kneecaps, raising the collective concerns of police, media, and locals that more body parts remained undiscovered within the bay. Six days later, on Sunday, May 16, the Virginia Beach Marine Patrol were alerted to the sighting of a small green suitcase floating in the current near the second artificial island of the Chesapeake Bay Bridge Tunnel.
据信这些手提箱是从上面的桥上扔进切萨皮克湾的，但由于该结构缺乏安全摄像头，因此没有在胶片上拍到这种行为。受害者的中段仍然失踪，从肚脐到膝盖骨，引起了警察、媒体和当地人的共同担忧，即海湾内还有更多身体部位未被发现。六天后的 5 月 16 日星期日，弗吉尼亚海滩海事巡逻队接到警报，称在切萨皮克湾桥隧第二人工岛附近的潮流中漂浮着一个小绿色的手提箱。

13
00:08:53.000 --> 00:09:36.000
In the worst condition of the lot, this suitcase was completely waterlogged and contained a black garbage bag covering the final piece of the unknown victim's body, the abdomen and thighs, dressed in a purple pair of fruit-of-the-loom brand briefs. His skull, nose, and teeth were still intact, preserving the overall look of his face and facilitating the creation of a composite sketch, which was featured throughout regional news reports. The image caught the attention of local couple John and Susan Rice, who believed it looked like their close friend William McGuire, better known as Bill.
这是所有箱子中状况最差的一个，这个手提箱完全浸水，里面装着一个黑色垃圾袋，覆盖着身份不明的受害者的身体的最后一部分，腹部和大腿，穿着一条紫色 Fruit of the Loom 品牌的内裤。他的头骨、鼻子和牙齿仍然完好无损，保留了脸部的整体外观，并便于制作综合素描，该素描在整个地区的新闻报道中都有出现。这张照片引起了当地夫妇约翰（John）和苏珊·赖斯（Susan Rice）的注意，他们认为这看起来像他们的密友威廉·麦奎尔（William McGuire），更广为人知的名字是比尔（Bill）。

14
00:09:36.000 --> 00:10:15.000
The Rices arrived to the Virginia Beach Police headquarters to view autopsy photos of the suitcase victim in an effort to confirm their identification. Sue was convinced it was Bill, but her husband was less certain, believing his best friend was alive, even though he hadn't heard from him in almost a month. This ran Bill McGuire's name through their database and found no record of the man having been reported missing. He did have a minor felony offense dating back to the early 80s for adopting aliases to write fraudulent checks.
赖斯夫妇来到弗吉尼亚海滩警察总部查看手提箱受害者的尸检照片，以确认他们的身份。苏确信那是比尔，但她的丈夫就不那么确定了，他相信他的最好朋友还活着，尽管他已经将近一个月没有听到他的消息了。这把比尔·麦奎尔的名字输入了他们的数据库，发现没有该男子被报告失踪的记录。他确实在 80 年代初有过轻微的重罪前科，因为采用化名开具欺诈性支票。

15
00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:57.000
Although he was never charged, Bill's fingerprints had been kept on file, which detectives sent for comparison against the suitcase victim. As they awaited the results of the fingerprint analysis, investigators dug further into Bill McGuire's history. The 39-year-old lived in a rental apartment three states north in the New Jersey township of Woodbridge with his wife and two young sons. A Navy veteran, Bill was currently employed as an adjunct professor at the New Jersey Institute of Technology and was the co-owner of software consulting company JVista Software.
尽管他从未被起诉，但比尔的指纹一直被存档，侦探们将其送去与手提箱受害者进行比对。在等待指纹分析结果的同时，调查人员进一步深入挖掘了比尔·麦奎尔的历史。这名 39 岁的男子与妻子和两个年幼的儿子住在新泽西州伍德布里奇（Woodbridge）镇北面三个州的租赁公寓里。作为一名海军退伍军人，比尔目前在新泽西理工学院（New Jersey Institute of Technology）担任兼职教授，并且是软件咨询公司 JVista Software 的联合创始人。

16
00:10:57.000 --> 00:11:38.000
Weeks earlier, on Wednesday, April 28, he finalized the purchase of a two-story colonial style homestead in the rural New Jersey township of Asbury. Two days later, on Thursday, April 30, a domestic violence restraining order had been filed against him by his wife, Melanie. Bill and Melanie had met while working in the hospitality industry and quickly fell head-over heels in love. By 1997, the pair moved in together as they concentrated on their long-term career goals, and by the end of the year, they were engaged.
几周前的 4 月 28 日星期三，他敲定了在新泽西州农村阿斯伯里（Asbury）镇购买一栋两层殖民地风格宅基地的事宜。两天后的 4 月 30 日星期四，他的妻子梅兰妮（Melanie）对其实施了家庭暴力限制令。比尔和梅兰妮在酒店业工作时相遇，并迅速坠入爱河。到 1997 年，两人在专注于长期职业目标的同时搬到了一起住，到年底，他们订婚了。

17
00:11:38.000 --> 00:12:21.000
Melanie was already two months pregnant with their firstborn by the time their wedding took place in June 1999 and fell pregnant again two years later. Many reported the pair seemed a perfect and equal match, sharing a sharp and sarcastic wit they played off one another. Bill was the mischievous practical joker who took immense pride in being a family man. Melanie, who was eight years his junior, was an intelligent and headstrong woman with a caring and compassionate side displayed through her work as a fertility nurse. Yet, the Maguire's unsteady marriage seemed indicative of a near-decade long relationship
到 1999 年 6 月他们举行婚礼时，梅兰妮已经怀有他们第一个孩子两个月了，并在两年后再次怀孕。许多人报告说，这对夫妇看起来是完美且平等的伴侣，分享着一种犀利而讽刺的机智，彼此配合默契。比尔是一个淘气的恶作剧者，为自己是一个顾家的人而感到无比自豪。小他八岁的梅兰妮是一个聪明而固执的女性，通过她作为生育护士的工作展现出富有爱心和同情心的一面。然而，麦奎尔夫妇不稳定的婚姻似乎预示着一段近十年的关系

18
00:12:21.000 --> 00:13:02.000
that had gone through its fair share of difficulties. The couple were not immune to squabbles and even fell foul of the law, with Bill caught driving with a suspended license and Melanie later lying under oath to protect him. Police discovered the restraining order Melanie had taken out against her husband had not yet been served, meaning Bill would not have been notified of it. Furthermore, a court date had not been set to make it permanent. Detectives contacted Melanie to inform her, and she explained that Bill hadn't been in contact since he left their apartment three weeks earlier.
经历了相当多的困难。这对夫妇并非免于争吵，甚至触犯了法律，比尔因驾照吊销开车而被抓，梅兰妮后来为了保护他而作伪证。警察发现梅兰妮对她丈夫申请的限制令尚未送达，这意味着比尔不会收到通知。此外，尚未设定使之永久生效的法庭日期。侦探联系了梅兰妮以通知她，她解释说，自从三周前离开他们的公寓以来，比尔一直没有联系过。

19
00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:41.000
She suspected he was having an affair, and was convinced he was either in Atlantic City where he was known to frequent the casinos, or Virginia Beach where he had always wanted to live. She had divorce papers ready, having filed the documentation with the state that described Bill as a volatile husband with a crippling gambling and drinking problem. Melanie explained that his behavior had recently become more erratic, with the desire to purchase a dream family home becoming an obsession, as he stayed awake for 48 hours at a time scrolling through real estate listings.
她怀疑他有外遇，并确信他要么在亚特兰蒂斯城（Atlantic City），那里以赌场众多而闻名，要么在弗吉尼亚海滩，他一直想在那里生活。她已经准备好了离婚文件，已向该州提交了文件，将比尔描述为一个反复无常的丈夫，有着严重的赌博和酗酒问题。梅兰妮解释说，他的行为最近变得更加古怪，对购买梦想家庭住宅的渴望变成了一种痴迷，因为他一次醒着 48 小时浏览房地产房源。

20
00:13:41.000 --> 00:14:24.000
She also claimed he threatened to kill her, resulting in her fleeing the apartment and placing their children in the care of her parents. The final straw came during a fight in the early morning hours of Thursday, April 29. Melanie stated Bill had, quote, Threatened to disappear, work under a false name and social security number, and never provide her with any financial support. He left the apartment that day, and since then, had made no effort to return, contact her, or provide financial support to his family.
她还声称他威胁要杀死她，导致她逃离公寓并把他们的孩子交由她父母照顾。最后一根稻草发生在 4 月 29 日星期四清晨的一场争吵中。梅兰妮陈述比尔，引述：“威胁要失踪，使用假名和社保号码，并且绝不给她提供任何经济支持。”他那天离开公寓，从那以后，没有做出任何努力回来、联系她或向他的家人提供经济支持。

21
00:14:24.000 --> 00:15:11.000
On Wednesday, May 26, 2004, Bill McGuire was finally located. The fingerprints stored in his police records were a match to the dismembered remains found in Chesapeake Bay. Deciding which police jurisdiction should front the investigation into Bill's murder was complicated, given there was no crime scene and he was last seen in his home state of New Jersey, but his body had surfaced in Virginia. Furthermore, the whereabouts of his Blackberry smartphone and vehicle, a blue 2002 Nissan Maxima, were unknown.
2004 年 5 月 26 日星期三，比尔·麦奎尔终于被找到了。他警察记录中保存的指纹与在切萨皮克湾发现的分尸遗骸相符。决定哪个警察辖区应该负责调查比尔的谋杀案很复杂，鉴于没有犯罪现场，他最后一次被看到是在他的家乡新泽西州，但他的尸体在弗吉尼亚州浮出水面。此外，他的黑莓智能手机和一辆蓝色 2002 款日产天籁汽车的下落不明。

22
